e establishing a new creative studio in Reality Labs led by Alan Dye, who has spent nearly 20 years leading design at Apple.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DR0Wsy0EhCP","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2203","post_id":"2203","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DR0F9gkEj1q","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-12-03","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2203/","text":"Inspired by all of you who started \"dear threads algo\" requests, we're going to test a new feature where if you post \"dear algo\" it will actually put more of that content in your feed!","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.com/@zuck/post/DR0F9gkEj1q","text_truncated":false}]